WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.577
This slide brings Module 3 together.

00:00:02.577 --> 00:00:06.287
Review the patterns you can now recognize and reuse.

00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:11.892
Focus on the decisions behind the syntax: what structure or method fits the problem,

00:00:11.892 --> 00:00:16.592
what assumptions are being made, and what you should check before trusting the result.

00:00:16.592 --> 00:00:21.867
Think about where this function would appear in a larger project.

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:28.387
Cleaning one value, calculating one metric, or validating one record can become a reusable function applied

00:00:28.387 --> 00:00:29.972
across many rows, files, or notebooks.

00:00:29.972 --> 00:00:35.742
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:35.742 --> 00:00:41.159
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
